{"slug": "kontakta-oss", "title": "Kontakta Oss", "template": "437", "tree": [{"t": "section", "id": "c460dc9", "cls": ["elementor-top-section", "elementor-section-boxed", "elementor-section-height-default", "elementor-section-height-default"], "gap": "elementor-column-gap-default", "overlay": false, "children": [{"t": "column", "id": "251b2250", "cls": ["elementor-col-50", "elementor-top-column"], "populated": true, "overlay": false, "children": [{"t": "text-editor", "id": "75227c26", "cls": [], "html": "<p><strong>Adress</strong></p><p>Convendum<br/>IPTV Sverige Lld<br/>Birger Jarlsgatan 57<br/>113 56 Stockholm<br/>Sverige</p><p>För <strong>allmänna ärenden</strong> och <strong>teknisk support</strong> hänvisar vi till</p><p><span style=\"color: #16a38a;\"><a href=\"mailto:supporten@sverigeiptv.net\" style=\"color: #16a38a;\">supporten@sverigeiptv.net</a></span></p><p>Det går snabbast att kontakta vår kundtjänst genom formuläret för support med ert ärende.</p>"}, {"t": "text-editor", "id": "3eaa11ba", "cls": [], "html": "<p>E-post:</p><p><span style=\"color: #16a38a;\"><a href=\"mailto:supporten@sverigeiptv.net\" style=\"color: #16a38a;\">supporten@sverigeiptv.net</a></span></p>"}]}, {"t": "column", "id": "3543760", "cls": ["elementor-col-50", "elementor-top-column"], "populated": true, "overlay": false, "children": [{"t": "heading", "id": "71821005", "cls": [], "tag": "h2", "size": "elementor-size-default", "html": "Kontakta IPTV Sverige LTD"}, {"t": "text-editor", "id": "5be55563", "cls": [], "html": "<p>På IPTV Sverige drivs vi att göra TV-tittande tillgängligt och överkomligt för alla. Detta oavsett var man befinner sig. Ingen ska behöva en hög månadskostnad för ett fåtal kanaler. Här är det tvärt om, du betalar en låg månadskostnad för alla TV-kanaler, filmer och videos i världen. Men en buffringsgaranti – pengarna tillbaka om du upplever buffring. Vi har de snabbaste och den senaste teknologin för din bästa tittarupplevelse. </p>"}, {"t": "heading", "id": "212d9eb7", "cls": [], "tag": "h2", "size": "elementor-size-default", "html": "Kontaktformulär"}, {"t": "form", "id": "5275837", "cls": ["elementor-button-align-stretch"], "fields": [{"tag": "input", "type": "text", "name": "form_fields[name]", "label": "Namn", "placeholder": "Namn", "required": true, "cls": ["elementor-field-type-text", "elementor-column", "elementor-col-100"], "rows": null}, {"tag": "input", "type": "email", "name": "form_fields[email]", "label": "E-post", "placeholder": "E-post", "required": true, "cls": ["elementor-field-type-email", "elementor-column", "elementor-col-100"], "rows": null}, {"tag": "textarea", "type": "text", "name": "form_fields[message]", "label": "Meddelande", "placeholder": "Meddelande", "required": false, "cls": ["elementor-field-type-textarea", "elementor-column", "elementor-col-100"], "rows": "4"}], "button": "Skicka"}]}]}], "seo": {"title": "Kontakta Oss för Snabb Kundtjänst Support", "description": "Have questions? Kontakta oss for assistance with IPTV services and enjoy your viewing without interruptions.", "canonical": "/kontakta-oss/", "robots": {"index": "index", "follow": "follow", "max-snippet": "max-snippet:-1", "max-image-preview": "max-image-preview:large", "max-video-preview": "max-video-preview:-1"}, "ogType": "article", "ogTitle": "Kontakta Oss för Snabb Kundtjänst Support", "ogDescription": "Have questions? Kontakta oss for assistance with IPTV services and enjoy your viewing without interruptions.", "ogImage": null, "published": null, "modified": "2026-08-07T10:00:35+00:00", "schema": {"@context": "https://schema.org", "@graph": [{"@type": "WebPage", "@id": "https://swedeniptv.net/kontakta-oss/", "url": "https://swedeniptv.net/kontakta-oss/", "name": "Kontakta Oss för Snabb Kundtjänst Support", "isPartOf": {"@id": "https://swedeniptv.net/#website"}, "datePublished": "2024-12-16T18:17:36+00:00", "dateModified": "2026-08-07T10:00:35+00:00", "description": "Have questions? Kontakta oss for assistance with IPTV s